      },
      "description": "Per-pipeline diagnostics from the tenzir node diagnostics stores. Live entries ship via each node's native diagnostics-to-loki pipeline (job=tenzir-diagnostics; labels: pipeline, severity, node \u2014 the referenced fields are consumed out of the shipped body, which keeps the rest of the record verbatim); pre-landing history stays visible from the scratch draft shipper (job=tenzir-diagnostics-draft; body: timestamp, pipeline_name, severity, message). Filter by node, then pipeline, then severity. Lines are JSON.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 40
      },
      "id": 12,
